                              |GKBMONKEY DRIVER
|YK0================================================================

|YKB'The great ape possesses the strength of five men and knows it.'
|WKO - |RKBMaster Chan|WKO
|YK0
The third and most powerful of the Monkey form attack is the
Monkey Driver. The Monk leaps forward with knuckles dragging,
grabs their foe, jumps high into the air, turning the enemy
upside down. The Monk then slams the enemy into the ground
headfirst telescoping the spine. This move is not able to be
executed successfully if the foe is not already stunned.

|GK0This is a Master of the North Wind power.

